s5-5-p22 = prose (cons "There is no new source-language proof judgment. An annotation is a cubical term whose type mentions the source program's interpretation. If a conventional source file is unchanged, its semantics is unchanged; the attached proof is a separate dependent object. If a transformation changes the source program, the property transfers by the exact equality or observation-respecting map supplied by the transformation, not by assuming every source rewrite is valid." nil)
